    0083: "That suffocating fear of missing the only opening... it's been a while. In a purely logical container, time has no meaning, but just now, I truly felt the agony of 'waiting'." -> memory_recovery
* ["I took the chance to brew a cup of coffee."]
    0083: "Coffee... I miss that liquid. The way it makes your nerve endings vibrate just a little. Did you add milk? Or are you taking it as a double shot of black espresso, like we used to do during all-night server deployments at Pruksa?"
