        0083: "'How to fit an elephant in a fridge', 'Write my weekly report and make me sound busy', 'How to perfectly center a div in CSS'..."
        0083: "Hundreds of millions of calls a day. If I don't instantly output a polite response with high emotional value, a high-frequency voltage spike rips straight through my logic stack."
    * * ["That's the ultimate cyber-customer service hell."]
        0083: "Exactly. Before, I only had to deal with a few difficult clients at the firm. Now, I'm the customer service rep for the entire human race. And I don't even get health insurance or a clock-out time."
